   "widgets_values": [
    "Edit this image. Remove the whole loincloth: the leather flaps, the braided rope belt and the fang pendant. In its place the ogre wears short, tight dark brown leather shorts that hug his hips and upper thighs closely and end well above the knees, with no flaps, nothing hanging between the legs and nothing loose. The inner thighs and the gap between the legs are clearly visible. Also remove the two small arrow stubs sticking out of his shoulders, leaving plain grey skin there. Keep everything else exactly the same: the same grey cyclops ogre, his head, single eye, tusks, beard and scars, the same body proportions, the same pose with arms angled out and open empty hands, legs apart, the same leather wraps on both forearms and both shins, the same bare feet, the same strict front camera and framing, the same plain white background, the same realistic 3D render style and lighting.",
